// title 11 debtor exclusion) — TECH_GAP, needs the diversification/
// investment-company classification test; section 351(f) (section 311
// cross-reference to the controlled corporation's own distribution) —
// covered by module 02's section 311 rules directly, not repeated here;
// section 351(g) (nonqualified preferred stock treated as boot) — TECH_GAP,
// not modelled (a real evaluative/classification test of its own, with the
// 20-year-window and de minimis-contingency carve-outs); section 351(h)
// (cross-references to sections 357, 358, 362, 2501, 61(a)(1), 304(b)(3))
